    test('merged holder beyond the recency window → stale archaeology, no release', ...)
    test('merged PR without the merge-window arm → not a holder, ignored', ...)
    test('no validated candidate → release still logged, deferrals continue, self-tick fires', ...)
    test('open armed holder still present → no merged probe, no release line', ...)
});
```

