Recency window: the merged PR body needs `merged_at` (REST list field) — the bot parses `closed_at || merged_at`... I'll read `merged_at || closed_at` ISO. Window default 24h; jobParam `mergedSlotHolderHours`? Hmm — let me name it `mergedHolderHours`. Actually — thinking about it more, do I want a knob? The bot already has staleHeadMinutes. I'll add `mergedSlotHolderHours` (default 24). Hmm, the simpler the better; but a knob is in-style and testable (test 2 uses the default 24h with a 3-day-old merge — no knob needed; test with knob? skip). Keep constant 24h default via jobParam override — I'll implement the jobParam since staleHeadMinutes sets precedent, and it costs 3 lines.

